# Exercise all replicated spell paths in one session: throw lantern,
# fire beam at a prop, place a portal pair.
1.0  goto 0 1.5 -2
1.5  throw_lantern  0 1.5 -2   0 4 -2
2.5  goto 0 1.5 4
3.0  beam   0 1.5 4   0 -0.243 -0.970   30  60
3.5  beam   0 1.5 4   0 -0.243 -0.970   30  60
4.5  place_portal primary    0 1.5 -3   0 0 1
5.0  place_portal secondary  3 1.5  0   -1 0 0
# Skip pickup here — beam-pushed props can collide with the lantern
# server-side and send it further than the throw velocity alone would
# predict, so the pickup goto target is unreliable. Lantern pickup is
# covered in its own scripted test (lantern_lifecycle.script).
9.0  exit
